# Run output, INCLUDING uploaded footage. `out/` alone was not enough: the real
# working directories are `out-live-ui/`, `out-ui/` and `out-mvp/`, and they hold
# the clips people uploaded — a third-party film among them. Without this a
# `gcloud builds submit` posts that footage to the Cloud Build staging bucket,
# which is the same mistake as leaving it in git history, with a shorter fuse.
out/
out-*/

# Public-domain test clips: ~10MB the image has no use for.
testdata/
